{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_24_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_24","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，二月，公會紀侯、鄭伯。己巳，及齊侯、宋公、衞侯、燕人戰。齊師、宋師、衞師、燕師敗績。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_24_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_24","textTraditional":"其言及者，由內及之也。其曰戰者，由外言之也。戰稱人，敗稱師，重眾也。其不地，於紀也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_24_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_24","textTraditional":"二、三月，葬衞宣公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_24_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_24","textTraditional":"三、夏，大水。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_24_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_24","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_24_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_24","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}